      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this study the authors compare the Ejection Fraction (EF) as determined by the Single Plane Ellipse Echocardiographic method versus the Ventriculographic EF. The authors emphasize the validity of the two-dimensional echocardiography to assess left ventricular EF in order to improve the clinical and pharmacologic management of the patients with the cardiac ischaemic disease."},
